      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠠᠲᠣᠨ</unicode>
      <uighur>qatun</uighur>
      <definition>(t)n. An imperial princess. A wife from a noble family. The yellow river.</definition>
      <page>566</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠲᠤᠨ ᠤᠨ ᠤᠷᠤᠬ</unicode>
          <definition>n. A yurt. House or family of a king or prince. A dynasty.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠲᠤᠨ ᠬᠠᠷᠢᠬᠴᠢ</unicode>
          <definition>n. The house-martin.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
